# What the Vercel CLI must never upload: secrets, dependencies, build output and docs. Every
# workspace package stays (the lockfile lists them all); Vercel builds apps/web (Root Directory).
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
apps/web/e2e/screenshots
infra
docs
load
.claude
.git
